                                │                                                                          │                                
                                │ tab           next view                                                  │                                
                                │ shift+tab     previous view                                              │                                
                                │ 1 2 3 4 5 6   dashboard · agents · factory · kaizen · ops · hanami       │                                
                                │ ←→/hl         kaizen page                                                │                                
                                │                                                                          │                                
                                │ r             range                                                      │                                
                                │ s             sort                                                       │                                
                                │ /             filter                                                     │                                
                                │ f             follow                                                     │                                
                                │ c             edit cap                                                   │                                
                                │                                                                          │                                
                                │ ?             help                                                       │                                
                                │ q             quit                                                       │                                
                                │                                                                          │                                
                                │ r cycles 24h · 7d · 30d · all; on the error screen it retries.           │                                
                                │ s sorts by recent · cost · subagent share.                               │                                
                                │ The mix and the pane under the table show the cursor row; enter opens a  │                                
                                │ session full screen. The tiles total every session.                      │                                
                                │ Mix shares are tokens without cache reads (input, output, cache write).  │                                
                                │ While a row is selected the order is held; s or the all row re-sorts.    │                                
                                │ A dot pulses on sessions written in the last 30 seconds.                 │                                
                                │ Factory: every 30 s while shown, asking GitHub; every 2 min off it, not. │                                
